# Internal notes stay local: work log, progress, verification records.
# Keep them in .internal/. The root-level names are ignored too, so a
# regenerated copy can't be committed by accident.
.internal/
/log.md
/PROGRESS.md
/DEVLOG.md
/verification*.json
